==Battleground==
*1 [[Kang Roo]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*5 [[Doge]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*5 [[Snache]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Kang Roo]] spawns after 56.67 seconds<sup>1,700f</sup>.
*1 [[Kang Roo]] spawns after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Squire Rel]] (10%) spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**3 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**5 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn, delay 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>.
**3 [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**3 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**2 [[One Horn]]s spawn, delay 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.
**3 [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**3 [[Squire Rel]]s (100%) spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**3 [[Neko Hakase (Enemy)|Neko Hakases]] spawn, delay 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

